@startuml
title SokoHub — Search Indexing & Query (OpenSearch)

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam arrowColor #2E7D32

package "SokoHub.Api" {
  boundary "SearchController\n/api/search\n[Authorize]" as SearchCtrl
  control "CatalogController\n(CRUD products)\ntriggers index" as CatCtrl
}

package "Application" {
  control "SearchIndexingJob\n(Enqueue changed product)" as IndexJob
  control "SearchRebuildJob\n(full reindex)" as RebuildJob
  control "ProductCreated/Updated/\nDeleted Integration Events" as ProdEvents
}

package "Infrastructure" {
  component "SearchService\n(catalog write model)" as SearchSvc
  component "SearchIndexer\n(write index)" as Indexer
  component "SearchQueryService\n(read/facet)" as QuerySvc
  component "OpenSearchClient\n(OpenSearch SDK)" as OsClient
  database "OpenSearch\n(product index)" as OsIndex
  database "Redis\n(SearchCache\nresult cache only)" as Redis
  database "MSSQL\n(Product, Variant,\nBrand, Category, Attr)" as Sql
  database "MongoDB\n(Audit Trail)" as Audit
}

control "RabbitMQ\n(IntegrationEventBus)" as Rabbit
control "Kafka\n(AuditEventProducer)" as Kafka

note right of OpenSearchClient
  ADR-011: OpenSearch for\nfaceted catalog search\n(Meilisearch for local).\nRedis used as *result\ncache only — NOT\nthe index store.
end note

note right of OsIndex
  Document = Product:\n- title, brand, category\n- attributes, variants\n- price, stock, rating\nNo PII stored in index.
end note

== Write / Index Path ==
CatCtrl -> Sql : Product CRUD\n(MSSQL)
CatCtrl -> ProdEvents : Publish\nProductCreated/Updated/Deleted
ProdEvents -> Rabbit
Rabbit -> IndexJob : enqueue\n(ProductCreatedEvent)
activate IndexJob
IndexJob -> SearchSvc : get product\nread model
SearchSvc -> Sql : query Product/Variant/Brand/Category
Sql --> SearchSvc : denormalized doc
SearchSvc -> Indexer : IndexAsync(doc)
Indexer -> OsClient : IndexDocument\n(POST _doc)\n(HTTPS)
OsClient -> OsIndex : upsert into\n`products` index
Indexer --> SearchSvc : indexed
SearchSvc -> Audit : log index op
SearchSvc --> IndexJob : done
IndexJob -> Kafka : publish SearchIndexEvent\n(audit stream)
deactivate IndexJob

note over IndexJob,OsIndex
  Failures → dead-letter queue\n→ SearchIndexingWorker\nretries with backoff.\nSearchRebuildJob =\nfull reindex sweep.
end note

== Read / Query Path ==
SearchCtrl -> QuerySvc : SearchAsync(\nquery, filters,\nfacets, page)
QuerySvc -> Redis : cache hit?\nkey: search:q:{hash}
alt cache hit
  Redis --> QuerySvc : cached results
else cache miss
  QuerySvc -> OsClient : SearchAsync\n(GET _search)\nfaceted query +\naggregations
  OsClient -> OsIndex : query DSL + filters
  OsIndex --> OsClient : hits + facets
  OsClient --> QuerySvc : results
  QuerySvc -> Redis : SetAsync(\nsearch:q:{hash},\nresults, 5m)
end
QuerySvc --> SearchCtrl : paged results\n(hits + facets)
SearchCtrl --> "Frontend (Nuxt)" : JSON

== Rebuild Path (maintenance) ==
RebuildJob -> SearchSvc : RebuildAllAsync()
SearchSvc -> Sql : full Product scan
Sql --> SearchSvc : all products
SearchSvc -> OsClient : BulkIndex\n(_bulk API)
OsClient -> OsIndex : recreate\n`products` index
OsClient --> SearchSvc : ok
SearchSvc -> Redis : Invalidate\nsearch:* keys
note right of RebuildJob : Scheduled (off-peak)\nzero-downtime via\nindex alias swap.

@enduml
